Package: papin-cli
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: terminal client for the remote Papin agent harness
 Ratatui chat client for papin-gateway: agent picker, streaming chat with
 thinking/tool-call/plan components, sessions with session/load resume,
 headless one-shot prompts, doctor connectivity checks, and agent
 management. Talks ACP v1 over WebSocket through the gateway.
 No systemd, no root.

Package: papin-gateway
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, adduser, wireguard-tools
Description: gateway exposing chrooted, socket-activated Papin agents over ACP
 Per-agent ACP v1 façade and proxy: registry + catalog REST, WebSocket ACP
 transport, capability policy, transparent crash healing, device-token auth,
 WireGuard peer enrollment. Ships the papin-acp-enter chroot wrapper (spawned
 by systemd socket activation) and the setuid papin-enroll-helper — the
 single root-capable component.
